    Get-AutomateNOWCommunicationNote -sortBy dateCreated

    .EXAMPLE
    Gets the first page of all Communication Notes of INFO or QUESTION type

    Get-AutomateNOWCommunicationNote -NoteType INFO, QUESTION

    .EXAMPLE
    Gets the first page of all Communication Notes with CLOSED or NEW status

