    .SYNOPSIS
    Exports the Communication Notes from an instance of AutomateNOW!

    .DESCRIPTION
    Exports the Communication Notes from an instance of AutomateNOW! to a local .csv file

    .PARAMETER CommunicationNote
    Mandatory [ANOWCommunicationNote] object (Use Get-AutomateNOWCommunicationNote to retrieve them)

