    ONLY [ANOWCommunicationNote] objects from the pipeline are accepted

    .OUTPUTS
    The [ANOWCommunicationNote] objects are exported to the local disk in CSV format

    .EXAMPLE
    Get-AutomateNOWCommunicationNote | Export-AutomateNOWCommunicationNote

    .EXAMPLE
    Get-AutomateNOWCommunicationNote -Id 'd7559a8a-b75d-4ed1-b170-6660c848cd65' | Export-AutomateNOWCommunicationNote

