Function Push-AutomateNOWProcessingTemplateAction {
    <#
    .SYNOPSIS
    Moves (pushes) a Processing Template Action to the top of the list (stack) within a Processing Template or Processing Template Item.

    .DESCRIPTION
    Moves (pushes) a Processing Template Action to the top of the list (stack) within a Processing Template or Processing Template Item.

    .PARAMETER ProcessingTemplateAction
    An [ANOWProcessingTemplateAction] object representing the Processing Template Action to be moved (pushed) to the top of the list (stack).

