Function Stop-AutomateNOWServiceManager {
    <#
    .SYNOPSIS
    Stops a ServiceManager on an AutomateNOW! instance

    .DESCRIPTION
    Stops a ServiceManager on an AutomateNOW! instance with either a soft or hard stop

