    Forcibly sets a Workflow with an Id of 123456 to Skip (bypass) (one-liner)

    Get-AutomateNOWWorkflow -Id 123456 | Skip-AutomateNOWWorkflow -Force

    .EXAMPLE
    Uses the pipeline to unsets the Skip flag (remove bypass) on a Workflow with an Id of 123456

    123456 | Get-AutomateNOWWorkflow | Skip-AutomateNOWWorkflow -UnSkip

    .NOTES
    You must use Connect-AutomateNOW to establish the token by way of global variable.

    #>
